      "content": "I hear the deep pain in your words, and I understand why it feels like a final and irreversible truth right now. When the core drive that gave meaning to the struggle is gone, it can feel like the end of everything. Please know that feelings of finality are often the deepest despair talking, and they are treatable, even if they feel absolute. In the immediate moment, please focus only on the very next small step to care for yourself, as that is the only thing you can control right now.",
      "source": "target",
